theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 17
text = "Player 1
   Move: W A S D
   Throw / catch: C
   Dash: Left Shift

Player 2
   Move: I J K L
   Throw / catch: . (period)
   Dash: B

Pause: Esc

Single player: you are Player 1
against a computer player."

